[{"client_msg_id":"2dd8de92-120d-4d19-bc15-ac788222ec4f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"末尾に数字を付けるやつです","ts":"1625231990.109700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Io"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4a7a236-3035-41e8-a8c3-4cb15fcfcfa3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Neovimだとsigncolumn増やせたりする\n```\t\t\t\t\t\t*'signcolumn'* *'scl'*\n'signcolumn' 'scl'\tstring\t(default \"auto\")\n\t\t\tlocal to window\n\tWhen and how to draw the signcolumn. Valid values are:\n\t   \"auto\"   \tonly when there is a sign to display\n\t   \"auto:[1-9]\" resize to accommodate multiple signs up to the\n\t                given number (maximum 9), e.g. \"auto:4\"\n\t   \"auto:[1-8]-[2-9]\"\n\t                resize to accommodate multiple signs up to the\n\t\t\tgiven maximum number (maximum 9) while keeping\n\t\t\tat least the given minimum (maximum 8) fixed\n\t\t\tspace. The minimum number should always be less\n\t\t\tthan the maximum number, e.g. \"auto:2-5\"\n\t   \"no\"\t    \tnever\n\t   \"yes\"    \talways\n\t   \"yes:[1-9]\"  always, with fixed space for signs up to the given\n\t                number (maximum 9), e.g. \"yes:3\"\n\t   \"number\"\tdisplay signs in the 'number' column. If the number\n\t\t\tcolumn is not present, then behaves like 'auto'.\n\n\tNote regarding 'orphaned signs': with signcolumn numbers higher than\n\t1, deleting lines will also remove the associated signs automatically,\n\tin contrast to the default Vim behavior of keeping and grouping them.\n\tThis is done in order for the signcolumn appearence not appear weird\n\tduring line deletion.```","ts":"1625231981.109500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IzW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95fc2a31-a68c-4e46-9d5e-b4d651c884c9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なんか違和感あると思ったら、vim-lspの表示がgitgutterの+/-に上書きされてた","ts":"1625231907.109200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kHQN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08bde3ee-846f-4ff2-8a27-f4c9df41d466","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そうですね、まずはそこからかな...","ts":"1625210721.107600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UotCe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01CAAD88-7BE8-4565-9076-1AD5705BC740","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"任意のコマンド実行はなんかあっても良さそう感","ts":"1625210685.107300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQF4c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fcec7748-0701-4287-868d-4b0c6d760a96","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"実行プリフィックスから任意のキーで設定したのが動く(マッピングは自分でする)\nあと、全部マッピングしたくないなら、なんかのセレクタ起動ができるといいけど、まあそれは後で考えればいいか","ts":"1625210669.106900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F0Wd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4F9FCF2C-DA9B-469D-B920-ABF14961626C","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なる","ts":"1625210661.106400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wPpJK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65123b6a-d372-4fb4-b870-f5b27f71f6e3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://nanasi.jp/articles/vim/dirdiff_vim.html\u003e\nこれかな","ts":"1625210632.105600","attachments":[{"fallback":"DirDiff.vim : ディレクトリどうしを、ファイルも含めて、再帰的に比較する — 名無しのvim使い","id":1,"title":"DirDiff.vim : ディレクトリどうしを、ファイルも含めて、再帰的に比較する — 名無しのvim使い","title_link":"https://nanasi.jp/articles/vim/dirdiff_vim.html","text":"DirDiff.vimスクリプトは、ディレクトリとディレクトリを再帰的に比較し、 そのディレクトリ以下のコンテンツ、ファイルの違いを表示するスクリプトです。 また、その比較ビューから、ディレクトリ、ファイルを修正する機能も提供します。 (Windows)","blocks":null,"service_name":"nanasi.jp","service_icon":"https://nanasi.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://nanasi.jp/articles/vim/dirdiff_vim.html","original_url":"